<title>ROMANIA: Romania cen.bank lifts one-week rate to 80 pct.</title>
<headline>Romania cen.bank lifts one-week rate to 80 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's central bank (BNR) on Thursday raised the minimum permitted rate for its one-week refinancing funds by 10 percentage points, to 80 percent.</p>
<p>The BNR said it also slashed refinancing funds on offer to 550 billion lei from last week's 750 billion.</p>
</text>
